  "details": "This is inconsistent with how it works in VR.\n\nI used to use the \"Select User\" function in the quick menu on desktop to look around for player nameplates while driving vehicles. This is now only possible in VR and no longer on desktop.\n\nThis applies to:\n\nUdon input events\n\nInput.GetKey\n\nInput.GetAxis\n\netc..\n\nPlease make this consistent with VR and allow Desktop inputs to go through while using the quick menu.",
